{"id":"5a44c3d4d465498993120b70ab568876","owner":"ncei_noaa","ownerId":"d85154e482aab27f1b7ad067ff7d813b","orgId":"C8EMgrsFcRFL6LrL","created":1624645879000,"modified":1785953239000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"Historical Tsunami Events","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS API for JavaScript","ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<p>This layer is used in the <a target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/maps/hazards/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>NCEI Natural Hazards Viewer<\/a>.<\/p><p>Natural hazards such as earthquakes, tsunamis, and volcanoes affect both coastal and inland areas. Long-term data from these events can be used to establish the past record of natural hazard event occurrences, which is important for planning, response, and mitigation of future events.&nbsp;NOAA's National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI)&nbsp;plays a major role in post-event data collection. The data in this archive is gathered from scientific and scholarly sources, regional and worldwide catalogs, tide gauge reports, individual event reports, and unpublished works. For more information, please see:&nbsp;<a style='color:rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family:Arial;' target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/natural-hazards' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:medium;'>https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/natural-hazards<\/span><\/a><br /><br />To view this service in an interactive mapping application, please see the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/maps/hazards/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Global Natural Hazards Data Viewer<\/a>&nbsp;(<a target='_blank' href='https://noaa.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=1b71abe428f446e992a3e01363729f99' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>NOAA GeoPlatform entry<\/a>) or&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/maps/tsunami-events/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Tsunami Events (1850-present) Time-Lapse<\/a>&nbsp;map viewer.<\/p><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>This is a feature layer displaying historical tsunami events from the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/hazard/tsu.shtml' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Global Historical Tsunami Database<\/a>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>NOAA's National Centers for Environmental Information<\/a>.<\/div>","tags":["tsunami","natural hazards","historical tsunamis","NOAA","NCEI","tsunami events"],"snippet":"A feature layer displaying historical tsunami events from NCEI's Global Historical Tsunami Database.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1625011029944.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-179.97100000000003,-69.417],[179.98400000000004,78.37]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":"NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI)","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":{"indexJobId":"","indexJobUrl":""},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services2.arcgis.com/C8EMgrsFcRFL6LrL/arcgis/rest/services/tsunami_events/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":26085704,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"commentsEnabled":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":1,"avgRating":3.75,"numViews":721700,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792404000000}